WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.190
JSON locale files map
keys to UI strings,

2
00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:06.477
and a translation has to keep keys,

3
00:00:06.477 --> 00:00:08.938
placeholders, and tags intact.

4
00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:13.040
General Translation translates
the values and keeps keys and

5
00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:14.653
placeholders unchanged.

6
00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:18.379
Plural keys differ by language,

7
00:00:18.379 --> 00:00:21.792
so Polish also needs
inbox_few and inbox_many.

8
00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:27.130
Point files.json.include in
gt.config.json at a locale pattern.

9
00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:31.686
Then npx gt translate reads the
English files and writes the

10
00:00:31.686 --> 00:00:32.521
German ones.

11
00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:35.774
Parse the JSON, compare the keys,

12
00:00:35.774 --> 00:00:38.223
and check each plural
family before review.

13
00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:41.261
Your team now ships
German with each release.
